@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC-09 - View Productivity Analytics

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "Desktop UI" as UI
participant "AnalyticsController" as Controller
participant "GetProductivityAnalyticsUseCase" as UseCase
participant "SessionAnalyticsReader" as SessionRepo
participant "AnalyticsSummaryAssembler" as Assembler
participant "AnalyticsMapper" as Mapper

Learner -> UI : open History and select a range
UI -> Controller : GET /api/v1/analytics/summary?from=...&to=...
Controller -> UseCase : get(AnalyticsQuery)
UseCase -> UseCase : validate paired inclusive local dates
UseCase -> UseCase : enforce 366-day limit for explicit ranges

UseCase -> SessionRepo : summarizeCompletedSessions(range)
SessionRepo --> UseCase : totals and daily work/break aggregates
UseCase -> Assembler : summarize(totals, daily, range)
activate Assembler
Assembler -> Assembler : compute totals and average session
Assembler -> Assembler : score = round(actual work / planned work × 100)
Assembler -> Assembler : zero-fill each requested date
Assembler -> Assembler : find best day across full selected range
Assembler --> UseCase : ProductivitySummary
deactivate Assembler
UseCase -> Mapper : toDto(summary, range)
Mapper --> UseCase : AnalyticsDto
UseCase --> Controller : AnalyticsDto
Controller --> UI : 200 OK\n{totals, focusScore, bestDay, daily}

note over SessionRepo
  The query reads completed sessions and their
  persisted work/break intervals. All time uses
  all sessions for totals and the latest 7 local
  calendar days for the daily chart.
end note

note over Assembler
  Focus score is clamped to 0..100. A zero planned
  work duration yields a score of 0. Distraction
  metrics are deferred until tracking exists.
end note

note over UI
  Render the response in the existing History
  screen layout. The selected range also filters
  the session list.
end note

@enduml
